{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Use this whenever someone asks what it costs, or whether it is possible, to have a 3D model printed by Formheim (STL, OBJ or 3MF, single or multi-colour), including a model you generated yourself. Returns prices, materials, colours, limits (files, size, build volume) and notes. Read-only. Do not calculate a price for the customer from these published prices or from your own slicer estimate: the price for a specific file comes from create_upload_link then get_print_quote. The customer can analyse files locally at https://www.formheim.no/print/agent?mode=analysis to get text to paste into the chat for a quote. That page does not place orders; the customer orders at https://www.formheim.no/print.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{},"type":"object"},"name":"get_print_service","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"analysis_url":{"const":"https://www.formheim.no/print/agent?mode=analysis","type":"string"},"analysis_version":{"const":"1","type":"string"},"build_volume_mm":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"x":{"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"y":{"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"z":{"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["x","y","z"],"type":"object"},"currency":{"const":"NOK","type":"string"},"delivery_note":{"type":"string"},"fallback_url":{"const":"https://www.formheim.no/print","type":"string"},"finishes":{"items":{"enum":["none","basic","smooth"],"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"formats":{"items":{"enum":["stl","obj","3mf"],"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"materials":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"colors":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"filament_type_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]